WEBVTT

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:04.540
The findings will help design guidelines
to operate HVAC systems to

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:09.520
accommodate infection control needs and
control energy costs to facilitate

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.340
a healthy and sustainable school
environment.

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:17.020
The trade-off analysis between reduced
airborne infection risks and

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:21.520
increased energy costs under various
scenarios and interventions provide

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.710
useful information for schools to prepare
for,

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.790
mitigate the consequences of,

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:31.650
respond to, and recover from the pandemic
and future epidemics,

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:36.600
and further instill the awareness of
health and sustainability in research

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.850
and policymaking.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:47.867
[Music continues]
